  - id: measuring_line_vision
    displayName: The Man with the Measuring Line
    flavorText: A man goes out to measure Jerusalem, and is told the city will grow
      too vast for walls, with the LORD himself a wall of fire round about her.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Promises Jerusalem will be repopulated so abundantly it must be inhabited
      as towns without walls, with the LORD himself as a wall of fire round about
      and the glory in her midst.
