  - id: flying_scroll_and_ephah_visions
    displayName: The Flying Scroll and the Woman in the Ephah
    flavorText: A giant flying scroll pronounces a curse on every thief and false
      swearer, and a woman named Wickedness is sealed in a measuring-basket and carried
      off to Shinar.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: 'Two paired visions of purging sin from the restored land: a flying
      scroll''s curse consuming the houses of thieves and false swearers, and Wickedness
      personified and physically removed to Shinar.'
    deliveredByManagerId: angel_of_the_lord
    managerId: flying_scroll_and_ephah_visions
