  - id: four_chariots_vision
    displayName: The Vision of the Four Chariots
    flavorText: Four chariots drawn by different-colored horses go out as the four
      spirits of the heavens, and those going north quiet the LORD's spirit there.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Closes the cycle of eight night visions with four chariots sent to the
      four winds of heaven as the four spirits of the heavens, picturing God's sovereignty
      over the nations.
    deliveredByManagerId: angel_of_the_lord
    managerId: four_chariots_vision
