  - id: shepherd_staves_and_thirty_pieces
    displayName: The Two Shepherd's Staves and the Thirty Pieces of Silver
    flavorText: Zechariah cuts a staff named Beauty to break a covenant, is paid
      thirty pieces of silver he casts to the potter, then cuts a staff named Bands
      to break a brotherhood.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: 'A prophetic sign-act of shepherding: two staves named Beauty and Bands
      are broken to show a covenant and a brotherhood broken, alongside the contemptuous
      payment of thirty pieces of silver.'
    deliveredByManagerId: zechariah_prophet
    managerId: shepherd_staves_and_thirty_pieces
